window.products.push({"id":859241,"name":"SID Travel Coffee Mug Spill Proof Insulated Tumbler with Lid, Leak Proof Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Coffee Mug, Keeps Drinks Hot Up to 8 Hours, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LKMtlpkbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make small strides towards eco-friendliness with a reusable insulated tumbler. Are you tired of countless drinking cups stacking up in your home and car? If so, then make the switch to SID’s stainless steel tumblers – a collection of 16-ounce tumblers designed to reduce messes while keeping your beverages the ideal temperature.  SID’s thermal cups offer the chance to reduce the consumption or disposable drinkware, by providing users with a long-term option that doesn’t end up in a landfill. Each reusable tumbler is fashioned in the form of a stainless steel cup, with a double wall vacuum insulation to ensure liquids maintain the ideal temperature.  Crafted for the daily commuter, wandering adventurer, and avid office fanatic, this travel mug is the ideal choice when on the go. Thanks to its insulated body, the double wall travel coffee mug is capable of keeping beverages hot for as long as 8 hours, and cold for up to 6. Unlike single-use drinking cups – which only maintain temperatures for up to 30 minutes.  Contrary to traditional travel mugs, the lids on our personalized tumblers are specially designed with a natural-sized drinking port to guarantee the even transfer of liquids. This is all made possible by the silicone seal, which prevents any hot or cold liquids from escaping the drinking cups.  Whether you’re looking for a reliable insulated cup to replace disposable cups, a gift for a friend, or a trustworthy mug for your daily beverages – you can rely on SID’s stainless steel tumblers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LKMtlpkbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SID","source_asin":"B0BH1L5MGT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-859241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BH1L5MGT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BH1L5MGT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
