window.products.push({"id":859362,"name":"PTCLTRAPS8 Clothes Moth Traps Replacement Strips 6 Strips Double Lure (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+gn8AFI6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"POWERFUL PREMIUM PHEROMONE: Captures the male by releasing a natural pheromone attractant, which leads to the female will not be fertilized and no further eggs will be laid. Moth traps are highly effective to catch clothes male moths to break the moth breeding cycle. ODOR-FREE & NATURAL AND SAFE: Health is more important than anything else.For the health of your family, please give up the harmful and inferior moth traps and moth balls,Dangerous chemical products have a lot of potential damage to your body. MOST EFFECTIVE MOTH TRAPS: Clothes moth pheromone catching target is Webbing (Common) Clothes Moth (Tineola bisselliella), Case Bearing (Making) Moth (Tinea pellionella), White Shouldered House Moth (Endrosis sarcitrella), and Brown House Moth (Hofmannophila pseudospretella). LONG-LASTING PROTECTION: The double moth pheromone is packed in two PVC hoses. The PVC hose needs to be cut before use, and the high-purity, large amount of pheromones will be quickly released into the air in a short time. For use with my store clothes moth traps box ,7*4 in .No need to remove closet items.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+gn8AFI6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PTCLTRAPS8","source_asin":"B07V63ZZ9R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-859362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V63ZZ9R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V63ZZ9R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":859363,"name":"Meat Thermometer, Instant Read Food Thermometer for Cooking, Waterproof Digital Kitchen Thermometer, Ultra Fast Cooking Thermometer Long Probe for Gri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l9VqBGODS._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍔【UltraL Fast And Accurate & High Heat Resistance】This instant read meat thermometer takes the temperature in a little as 2-3 seconds, and is accurate to +/-1 ℉. Made of food grade SUS304, the probe can withstand temp from -58°F to 572°F (-50°C to 300°C). To Provide quick and accurate temperature, taking the guesswork out of cooking any food, whether you're grilling, BBQ roasting, or deep-frying. 🍗【Long & 180°Roating Probe】The probe of this cooking thermometer's length is 4.6\" with ultra-thin & sensitive 1.5mm diameter pointed head, enables a deep reach into the center of large roasts and loaves. The 180° rotating feature makes it can measure food from different angle, and it can be folded up to store. 💦【IP67 Waterproof & Solidly Built】Waterproofness of our food thermometer allows to be cleaned in water with ease. And not worry that food's steam would destroy thermometer. The high quality ABS material makes it firm and durable, can withstand impact and accident drops. It's a big progress for the service life. 🍺【Compact Design for Easy To Use】Our digital meat thermometer is full-featured, but simplistic and intuitive to operate, meet all your need. ① LCD backlight is great for reading temps in poor light. ② Comes with meat temp guides on meat thermometer device, don't have to look it up every time. ③ Internal Magnetic back to allow it attached on the fridge. ④ Calibration function adjusts probe sensor back to the correct accuracy. ⑤ A built-in bottle opener. 🎁【Extra Oven Thermometer - A Big Bonus 】Range from 0 to 600°F/ 0 to 300°C to meet different requirements and demands. Big Screen for easy read. Will Not worry the oven temp is wonky to cause a bad bake. Oven Thermometer + digital thermometer for cooking is a perfect cooking match which is the first step to make a delicious food.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l9VqBGODS._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maliton","source_asin":"B089LPMSTJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-859363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089LPMSTJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089LPMSTJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
