window.products.push({"id":859402,"name":"3Pack Pre-Filters Replacement Compatible with Dyson DC58,DC59,V6,V7,V8 Vacuum Washable Replacement Filter ,Cordless Vacuum Cleaners-Replaces 965661-01","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eTXJ4xIfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These pre filter replacement helps to improve the suction of the vacuum cleaner,To keep optimum performance, pre filters should be replaced every 2-3 months especially if you have pets.Replacing your pre filters in time may help reduce odor,improve vacuum performance,increase exhaust air quality,extend vacuum life,and most importantly help maintain a cleaner,fresher home! Fit Models: Dyson DC58,DC61,DC59 Motorhead,DC72,SV04,DC59,DC62,SV03,SV06,SV09 Absolute V7 SV11 V8 SV10AN V8 Absolute SV10. What you will get: 3 x 965661-01 Pre Filters and 1 x cleaning brush.This complete set provides a brush for those stubborn hairs or fabrics that can get stuck on your roller and also good for cleaning your filter. Easy to Install: Dry your hands and then place the thoroughly dried filter into your vacuum cleaner.It just cost you few minutes,save your time and worth your money. Note: No need to wash the new filters,but better to wash them once a month after use,they are Washable and Reusable,just clean by hand with warm soapy water regularly,Wait them dry out before reusing. Do Not wash in dishwasher or washing machine Warm tips: Disconnect the power before installing this part in case of any danger.Wear work gloves to protect your hands before replace the new pre filters.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eTXJ4xIfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sikawai","source_asin":"B097Y4C1QC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-859402","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097Y4C1QC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097Y4C1QC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
