window.products.push({"id":859631,"name":"Bush Business Furniture Series C 72W x 36D Bow Front U Shaped Desk with Mobile File Cabinets in Hansen Cherry","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1506.6,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31gHsIFahJL._AC_.jpg","description":"Sophisticated and spacious, this Bush Business Furniture Series C U Shaped Desk brings commercial-quality features and durability to the workplace. The expansive wraparound U Shaped Desk includes all the room a busy professional needs to spread out for years of productivity. An inviting Bow Front design offers an extended surface for guests to pull up chairs and collaborate, while integrated wire management controls your electronics cables for a tidy workspace. The thermally fused laminate surface and sturdy construction combine with Brushed Nickel hardware and extended modesty panels for a lasting professional appearance you'll love. Take care of your storage needs with a pair of Mobile File Cabinets, which fit under the Desk or roll anywhere. The Cabinets lock for your security and feature 3 full-extension file drawers and 2 box drawers combined. The options are endless with Series C. Backed by a 10 Year Warranty, the collection withstands the rigors of a 40-plus hour week. Multiple layout options and 7 finishes meet the needs of numerous workspaces. Series C evolves with your preferences, allowing you to reconfigure your office as required with a complete line of coordinated products. American made with U.S. and imported parts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31gHsIFahJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bush Business Furniture","source_asin":"B0C1GG4L2C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-859631","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1GG4L2C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1GG4L2C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":859632,"name":"Wooden Modern Kids Coat Hooks for Wall 3\" Decorative Hat Hanger Towel Rack Natural Wood Hook Vintage Backpack Organizer White Pink Yellow Blue Pack of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hq889XOCS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Decorative wall wood hooks are a perfect organizer for a coat, towel, robe, hat, backpack, jewelry, keys to hang at home, office, bar or loft. You can use it also as a wooden wall-mounted decor at the office entryway - black and white colors will support business style. A set of 4 pcs is suitable for display baseball caps or add creativity to your storage. Wooden wall hooks are more than just functional - they make your place stylish and natural (no matter what you need - vintage or modern home design). Natural wood coat hangers - make your place both functional and stylish! Specifications. Product Technical Details Package：4pcs / lot Material: Ashwood hooks, metal screw, plastic wall anchor Color: Black and White Surface: Natural Wax Oil process Hook size: Length (short side): 3.1\" (7.8 cm) // diameter: 0.9\" (2.2cm) EASY TO INSTALL: ① Make a 0.3\" (8 mm) hole on the wall ② Insert wall anchor into the hole and screw on - stop at about 0.2\" (5 mm) from the wall ③ Hang up wooden hook About VIRKE: We believe that home design affects the inner state of a person and the whole family. So high-quality home accessories help you feel comfortable at home and inspire you for better living. That is why we pay a lot of attention to every product's design and quality and detail. Natural materials (mainly wood), pleasing to eye colors, minimalism in design - that is what we offer you. VIRKE products are designed in Scandinavia and manufactured with great attention to detail. 100% natural wood. If there are any issues, we'll give you a full refund or replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hq889XOCS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"virke","source_asin":"B096YCDCYV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-859632","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096YCDCYV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096YCDCYV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
