window.products.push({"id":859675,"name":"2-Pack Replacement Magnetic Stove Thermometer Wood Burner Top Thermometer Stove Temperature Meter Stove Flue Pipe Thermometer Fireplace Accessories fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wpvTdMoEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Product strengths: A magnet on the back offers a convenient placing, the stove flue pipe thermometer can be placed on stove top or side.The creosote buildup, optimum performance and overheat period is noted on the dial to monitor and optimize the work efficiency of your stove, easy to read with large dial. Changing of different temperature: Creosote buildup indicates temperature is too low which can cause creosote and tar deposits in the stove and chimney. Optimum performance indicates the fuel consumption and heat output are at its most efficient level. Overheat indicates temperature is too high, risks of stove/chimney/stove fan being damaged. Specifications: Measuring range: 100-900 ℉/100-500 ℃ Color: as shown in the picture Material: aluminum dial, bimetal sensor, brass pointer and metal handle Dial size: 2.45 inch/ 6 cm in length","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wpvTdMoEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZHOUWHJJ","source_asin":"B08N4XC17F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-859675","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08N4XC17F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08N4XC17F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":859676,"name":"Viking Enamel Cast Iron Dutch Oven, 5 Quart","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nnydlqQUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Viking Cast Iron is a natural addition to the Viking kitchen, maximizing the performance of Viking stoves, and all stoves, by providing the natural heat retention required for roasting, braising, searing and more. Designed for efficiency, most cooking can be done on low to medium heat. Viking Cast Iron will distribute and retain the heat evenly, allowing the pan to reach and maintain ideal cooking temperatures with lower energy requirements. Conversely, cast iron holds cold temperatures equally well for food storage and serving or preparing cold recipes. Viking Cast Iron features a non-reactive glossy enamel interior that is durable enough to handle metal utensils but will not react with foods, maintaining the flavor during cooking. While enamel is not a non-stick surface, the enamel coating does feature stick-resistant properties aiding in cleanup. The exterior of each piece is coated with matte enamel that helps resist chips and cracks while keeping maintenance to a minimum. The Dutch Ovens and other Braiser feature  lid spikes on the interior of the lid to \"self-baste\" by distributing condensation back into the pot during cooking. The end result means less evaporation, keeping meets tender while helping to retain vegetable nutrients that may otherwise evaporate. Viking Cast Iron is safe for use on the stove, the grill, and in the oven, while being elegant enough to take directly to the table for serving.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nnydlqQUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Viking Culinary","source_asin":"B01M71LN6M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-859676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M71LN6M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M71LN6M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
