window.products.push({"id":859686,"name":"Gr8ware 13oz Travel Coffee Mug with Lid, Leak Proof Coffee Travel Mug for Hot/Iced Drinks, Double Wall, Vacuum Insulation - Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619uohCDXuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether you are going to the beach or backyard barbecue, the double-walled vacuum insulated stainless steel coffee cup, can be brought anywhere, so you can enjoy the moment. The BPA-free lid is made of impact-resistant, stain-resistant, and odor-resistant plastic, so you don't have to worry about lingering taste or smell. When you are on road trip, you will be happy to know that your cup fits most car cup holders easily, and the silicone bottom cushion prevents slippage on other surfaces. At the end of the day, throw the cup and lid on the top rack of the dishwasher for easy cleaning, but remember to wash it by hands. Temperature control Possibly the most important feature of a travel coffee mug is to keep your coffee as hot or cold as you like for as long as you’re drinking it. Gr8ware travel coffee mugs are built to maintain temperature with specific design features including vacuum-sealed walls, stainless steel materials, and airtight lids. It can keep coffee warm for hours. Spill-proof With sturdy rubber gaskets and a locking lid, it can keep liquid from leaking out effectively. Easy to clean When you’re on the go, cleaning dishes can be a challenge. Gr8ware travel coffee mugs that are easy to clean have fewer parts to disassemble, no crevices that can trap gunk in hard-to-reach places and wide mouths so you can scrub thoroughly inside and out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619uohCDXuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gr8ware","source_asin":"B09Z7QFRPQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-859686","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z7QFRPQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z7QFRPQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
