window.products.push({"id":859734,"name":"Hosley Olive Crumple Glass Votive Floral Vase LED Lantern Tealight Holder 4 Inch Diameter Ideal Gift for Wedding Party Home Decor Tropical LED Tealigh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lNEdrsJFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Hosley Olive Crumple Glass Vase. For use with Tealight & Votive Candles & LED Tealight & Votive Candles. Hosley's tealight/votive candle holders will add a touch of elegance to your special event, home decor or romantic dinner while creating a subtle and warm ambiance. Our tealight/votive candle holders make the perfect gift for any occasion including weddings, parties, holidays, spa, reiki, ect. Our candle holders will allow you to have a wonderful opportunity in bringing new fragrances into your home. These candle holders will compliment existing decor along with adding a perfect centerpiece to your special event. Our tealight/votive candle holders are equally well suited for a variety of indoor and outdoor uses, including emergency power outages or simply providing warm, ambient light. Be sure to keep your emergency kit stocked with extra Hosley candle holders. To maximize the burn of your candle, we suggest trimming and maintaining the wick to 1/8”. Trimming the wick helps maintain an even burn and helps keep the flame from getting too close to the glass. As a general rule, we also suggest using for no more than 4 hours at a time to maximize the burn duration. Always use on heat/flame resistant surface and burn within sight. Keep away from things that can catch fire and away from children and pets. Always keep the wax pool clear of wick trimmings, matches and debris at all times.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lNEdrsJFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hosley","source_asin":"B00PJ5L1IG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-859734","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PJ5L1IG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PJ5L1IG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
