window.products.push({"id":859749,"name":"FACE TWO FACE Throw Blanket Microfiber Polyester to Support The Family decorates a car Right Sofa Bed is Super Soft and Warm (60\"×80\", Yellow)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LqmM99X9L._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"Your night in isn't complete without the coziest throw blanket around to ease you into total comfort and relaxation. FACE TWO FACE Throw Blanket will be your go-to for dozes on the couch and insulation from harsh winter chill. Its double-sided construction features a fleece top and a wool-like Sherpa reverse, giving an enticingly cozy contrast that's functional and sophisticated.   A high-density polyester with extremely fine fibers, making microfiber lightweight yet extremely durable. The fibers give it hypoallergenic properties, making it perfect for people with sensitive skin or allergies. Microfiber’s intense density also makes it completely resistant to shrinking and wrinkling.    Our luxurious Sherpa blanket is super soft, thick, and plush. Made from 100% microfiber yarn, it's cozy and suitable year-round. Cuddle up in bed, on a chair or couch and it will keep you warm and comfortable. The top layer features a velvety soft mink-like fabric that comes in beautiful contemporary colors, without pilling or falling apart. At FACE TWO FACE Designs, we believe in delivering stylish, quality bedding at an exceptional price. We've made it our mission to become the leading retailer of premium home textiles. We take pride in every stitch and weave of our fabrics and develop bedding solutions that bring sophistication and warmth to your living space. For chic, modern bedding at the right price point, you can count on us to deliver. We want to make it irresistible to stay in bed for just another minute","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LqmM99X9L._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FACE TWO FACE","source_asin":"B06XJ3WMVD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-859749","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XJ3WMVD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XJ3WMVD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":859750,"name":"Yatsen Bridge Globalartwork- HD Print 5 Piece Modern Abstract Oil Painting on Canvas Wall Art Pictures for Living Room Framed Ready to Hang As Unique ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610y8T1eYSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"High quality hand-Artwork is printed at high resolution with vivid color on thick high quality canvas to create the look and feel of the original nature and masterpiece. Picture is already perfectly stretched on thick wooden frame.The side margins are also printed to create a particularly decorative effect. Canvas Wall Art is the modern way to brighten the walls of your home, and relax you after work.It is sure to captivate wherever it is hung. About Giclee Prints There are at least Three basic criteria, which must be met in order for the print to be considered a true giclee... 1. For giclee printing, the paper or substrate used to actually print the final piece must be acid free and consists of a 100% cotton base. 2. Any image that is to be printed as a giclee needs to be created at a resolution of no less than 300 dots per inch (DPI). This is to ensure that the final print has the sharpest detail and lacks any of the fragmentation that can occur with images less than 300 DPI. 3. The last step to creating or confirming a true giclee print is the type of ink and printer used. The biggest contrast between a standard inkjet print and a giclee print is that giclees are printed using pigment-based inks rather than the dye-based inks found in lower cost inkjets. Pigment-based inks have a longer life span that can last anywhere from 100 to 200 years without significant fading.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610y8T1eYSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yatsen Bridge","source_asin":"B077BXHKHV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-859750","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077BXHKHV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077BXHKHV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
