window.products.push({"id":859911,"name":"Ankou Food Storage Containers with Lids Airtight Set of 4(0.32qt). Airtight Push-Open&Close Value Pack for Cereal, Flour, Sugar, Pasta,etc.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zHu1gYGZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Ankou Food Storage Containers with Lids Airtight, Value Pack for Cereal, Flour, Sugar, Pasta,etc. If you dream of a uniform and well-organized kitchen pantry, where one food container coordinates with the others and are BPA-free, then you've come to the right place. Ankou US presents Air Tight Food Storage Containers with 4 small Containers with removable and washable lids, moisture-proof and airtight food preservation. People take care of their healthy foods that include its preparation but the containers where they are served are equally important. You will definitely love our beautiful crystal-clear design, let's amaze your pantry and take it to the next level! MODULAR STACKABLE DESIGN: Create a neat and organized space. Pantry organization calls for space-saving storage. All of our food storage containers feature stackable designs. These containers easily nest when not in use and when in use their stacking feature allows for safe, stable stacking with other containers of the same brand, or even with similar brands. POP UP LID WITH SILICONE AIRTIGHT SEAL: Keep contaminants out of your food during storage. This ensures that your ingredients remain fresh and dry for a long period of time. Push the button down for an airtight seal that opens again with another simple press of the button. When the button is popped open, it doubles as a built-in handle for the lid. SHATTER-PROOF PLASTIC IS STAIN AND ODOR RESISTANT: Food storage containers are designed to resist food acids and oils to maintain their clarity even after extended use. To clean, wash each container in the dishwasher or with mild soap and warm tap water. The caps easily twist open for deeper cleaning if necessary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zHu1gYGZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ankou","source_asin":"B08CKBL7SB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-859911","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CKBL7SB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CKBL7SB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
